ilability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/367520/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Extremamente positivas","totalReviews":568792,"positive":551221,"negative":17571,"recommendPercent":97,"praise":"Hallownest, a exploração e a arte desenhada à mão são lembrados com muito carinho.","caveat":"A dificuldade e a necessidade de explorar sem muitas indicações podem frustrar alguns jogadores.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/367520/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
  ('hollow-knight-silksong', 'Hollow Knight: Silksong', '2025', 'Hollow Knight: Silksong', 'Jogo', '90', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1030300/library_600x900_2x.jpg', 'https://store.steampowered.com/app/1030300/', '{"id":"hollow-knight-silksong","steamAppId":1030300,"name":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","originalName":"HOLLOW KNIGHT: SILKSONG","year":2025,"releaseDate":"4 set. 2025","developer":"Team Cherry","publisher":"Team Cherry","franchise":"Hollow Knight: Silksong","category":"Jogo","genres":["Ação","Aventura","Indie"],"platforms":["PC","macOS","Linux"],"modes":[],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1030300/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"provider":"steam","id":"257186996","title":"Release Trailer English","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1030300/970174968/f2c514c96548048dd1dca6ef500877916b75fe5a/1755841475/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764916585","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257186996/ac1c4277feccd41b0866ffec5d0d40b605df1851/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764916585"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256742997","title":"Reveal Trailer","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1030300/209267/a7f0f21deb650c2ebbd0e7a9bcd44a1b8c8b5868/1751178761/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755838174","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256742997/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1755838174"}],"screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030300/26950369fe4b03c2268620eb9815c8a246aa0b06/ss_26950369fe4b03c2268620eb9815c8a246aa0b06.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776125736","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030300/09ccaa6c16f158f9df8298feb5d196098506a028/ss_09ccaa6c16f158f9df8298feb5d196098506a028.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776125736","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030300/d1a893ec6357b347a55ed929833ba793b57a79d2/ss_d1a893ec6357b347a55ed929833ba793b57a79d2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776125736","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030300/856e33e755a0b9a785c645d116036516ea08812b/ss_856e33e755a0b9a785c645d116036516ea08812b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776125736","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030300/8e09f2b2eedd3fa9b4479dd5c26d8bdf60562478/ss_8e09f2b2eedd3fa9b4479dd5c26d8bdf60562478.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776125736","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030300/d907d0cc2b10b5ea4788b8d502cc27787d520c1d/ss_d907d0cc2b10b5ea4788b8d502cc27787d520c1d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776125736"],"score":"90","tagline":"Discover a vast, haunted kingdom in Hollow Knight: Silksong! Explore, fight and survive as you ascend to the peak of a land ruled by silk and song.","description":"Become the Princess Knight\\n As the lethal hunter Hornet, adventure through a kingdom ruled by silk and song! Captured and taken to this unfamiliar world, prepare to battle mighty foes and solve ancient mysteries as you ascend on a deadly pilgrimage to the kingdom’s peak.\\n\\n Hollow Knight: Silksong is the epic sequel to Hollow Knight, the award winning action-adventure. Journey to all-new lands, discover new powers, battle vast hordes of bugs and beasts and uncover secrets tied to your nature and your past. \\n\\n Game Features\\n Discover the fallen insect kingdom of Pharloom! Explore mossy grottos, gilded cities and misted moors as you ascend to the shining citadel at the top of the world.\\n\\n Engage in lethal acrobatic action! Wield a huge suite of deadly moves as you dance between foes in swift, beautiful combat.\\n\\n Craft powerful tools! Master an ever-expanding arsenal of weapons, traps, and mechanisms to vanquish your enemies and explore new heights.\\n\\n Solve shocking quests! Hunt down rare beasts and solve ancient mysteries to grant the wishes of the downtrodden and restore the kingdom’s hope.\\n\\n Face over 200 ferocious foes! Beasts and hunters, monsters and knights. Defeat them all with bravery and skill!\\n\\n Vanquish over 40 legendary bosses! Battle fabled heroes and fallen kings in epic combat to decide the kingdom''s fate.\\n\\n Challenge Steel Soul mode! Once you conquer the kingdom, test your skills in a new mode that presents a more formidable challenge.\\n\\n Experience a stunning orchestral score! Hollow Knight’s award-winning composer, Christopher Larkin, brings melancholy melodies, symphonic strings and heart-thumping, soul strumming boss themes to the adventure.","highlights":["Ação","Aventura","Confira os trailers e as imagens da ficha."],"specs":null,"availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1030300/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Muito positivas","totalReviews":428278,"positive":383586,"negative":44692,"recommendPercent":90,"praise":"Combate, animação e construção do mundo são elogiados por quem se conecta à aventura.","caveat":"As críticas consultadas apontam dificuldade punitiva, deslocamentos longos e progressão frustrante.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1030300/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
  ('it-takes-two', 'It Takes Two', '2021', 'It Takes Two', 'Jogo', '89', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1426210/library_600x900_2x.jpg', 'https://store.steampowered.com/app/1426210/', '{"id":"it-takes-two","steamAppId":1426210,"name":"It Takes Two","originalName":"IT TAKES TWO","year":2021,"releaseDate":"25 mar. 2021","developer":"Hazelight Studios","publisher":"Electronic Arts","franchise":"It Takes Two","category":"Jogo","genres":["Ação","Aventura"],"platforms":["PC"],"modes":["Co-op","Co-op online","Co-op, ecrã partilhado/dividido"],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1426210/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"provider":"steam","id":"256827093","title":"Official Trailer","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1426210/356092/0165ad2494097e40af29c015e8948175c3fb97a8/1750688156/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1616514535","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256827093/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1616514535"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256825938","title":"#5","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1426210/354187/6ff654f630353840eb67702884d2d7827c676457/1750686862/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1615809022","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256825938/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1615809022"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256813190","title":"Friends Pass","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1426210/332824/ea5dc1a28710c18ca33602ef0a6b2dfe06693142/1750686858/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1607655633","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256813190/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1607655633"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256813189","title":"Reveal","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1426210/332823/5130787ad6a22c30c84b2f33f4b990878dfa2b33/1750686827/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1607655625","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256813189/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1607655625"}],"screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426210/ss_3e59753eefaba9a7704a18e902b48e8d38e95e0b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777395376","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426210/ss_6e987a0678b013bfd0073a9ac4703e1f04ca4dea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777395376","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426210/ss_fdac523e3ea4d2f32a44449bb8c224857563bd7d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777395376","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426210/ss_4a62bc8fa398fc5b2094a6225dc5ecff9485f824.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777395376","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426210/ss_a15164ddd357ab3c0b2aff575a6b215b2d91b406.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777395376","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426210/ss_d7a931229cbf1cc25975bb5860cbde5b9bbc826a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777395376"],"score":"89","tagline":"Entra na caminhada mais louca da tua vida em It Takes Two. Convida um amigo para jogar gratuitamente com o Passe de Amigo* e trabalha em conjunto em toda a variedade de desafios de jogo alegres e inquietantes.","description":"Entra na aventura mais louca da tua vida em It Takes Two, um novo género de aventura de plataforma, criado exclusivamente para Coop. Convida um amigo para jogar gratuitamente com o Passe de Amigo* e trabalha em conjunto em toda a variedade de desafios de jogo alegres e inquietantes. Joga com o casal em confronto, Cody e May, dois humanos transformados em bonecos por um feitiço mágico. Em conjunto, presos num mundo fantástico em que o imprevisível está ao virar da esquina, são recorrentemente desafiados pela salvação do seu relacionamento fraturado. \\n\\nDomina as habilidades de personagens únicas e associadas em todos os novos níveis. Ajudem-se mutuamente através de obstáculos inesperados e momentos hilariantes. Chuta as caudas peludas de esquilos mafiosos, pilota um par de cuecas, sê DJ num clube noturno agitado e desliza de trenó através de um globo de neve mágico. Abraça uma história sincera e hilariante onde a narrativa e a jogabilidade tecem uma experiência única e metafórica. \\n\\nIt Takes Two é desenvolvido pelo estúdio premiado, Hazelight, líder da indústria de jogo cooperativo. Estão prestes a levar-te numa aventura maravilhosa onde apenas uma coisa é certa: somos melhores juntos.\\n\\n CARACTERÍSTICAS PRINCIPAIS \\n\\n Pura perfeição cooperativa — Convida um amigo a jogar gratuitamente com o Remote Play Together** e vive uma aventura entusiasmante contruída puramente para dois. Escolhe entre jogar no sofá ou em coop. online com ecrã dividido e enfrenta desafios constantes onde a única forma de os superar é trabalhando em conjunto.\\n\\n Jogabilidade fluída e inquietante — Desde os aspiradores a vácuo aos gurus do amor, nunca sabes o que enfrentarás a seguir. Repleto de desafios inovadores no género e de novas capacidades de personagem para dominares em todos os níveis, vive uma fusão metafórica de jogabilidade e narrativa que superam a fronteira da narrativa interativa. \\n\\n Um Conto Universal de Relacionamentos — Descobre uma história comovente e sincera sobre os desafios da boa convivência. Ajuda Cody e May a saber como superar as suas incompatibilidades. Conhece um elenco diversificado de personagens estranhas e cativantes. Junta forças e segue numa aventura que irás apreciar em conjunto!\\n ACERCA DE HAZELIGHT \\nHazelight é um estúdio de desenvolvimento de jogos independente e premiado com base em Estocolmo, na Suécia. Fundado em 2014 por Josef Fares (realizador de cinema e criador do premiado jogo Brothers: A Tale of Two Sons), Hazelight empenha-se a superar os limites criativos do que é possível nos jogos. Em 2018, Hazelight lançou o jogo vencedor de um BAFTA - A Way Out - o primeiro jogo de sempre cooperativo e de aventura de ação na terceira pessoa — como parte do programa EA Originals. \\n\\n ACERCA DO EA ORIGINALS \\nO EA Originals ajuda a iluminar alguns dos mais apaixonados, independentes e talentosos estúdios de jogos do mundo inteiro. Descobre experiências inovadoras e inesquecíveis de jogos de fabricantes de jogos altamente criativos que adoram encantar e inspirar.","highlights":["Ação","Aventura","Co-op","Confira os trailers e as imagens da ficha."],"specs":null,"availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1426210/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Extremamente positivas","totalReviews":273631,"positive":261156,"negative":12475,"recommendPercent":95,"praise":"A variedade de fases e a cooperação obrigatória criam momentos divertidos para jogar em dupla.","caveat":"Humor e personagens dividem opiniões, e algumas avaliações acham puzzles ou chefes pouco inspirados.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1426210/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
  ('minecraft', 'Minecraft', '2011', 'Minecraft', 'Jogo', '93', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1928870/library_600x900_2x.jpg', NULL, '{"id":"minecraft","name":"Minecraft","originalName":"MINECRAFT","year":2011,"releaseDate":"18 de novembro de 2011","developer":"Mojang Studios","publisher":"Mojang Studios","genres":["Sandbox","Sobrevivência","Aventura"],"platforms":["PC","Consoles","Celulares"],"modes":["Um jogador","Multijogador online"],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1928870/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"id":"MmB9b5njVbA","title":"Trailer oficial de Minecraft","kind":"TRAILER"},{"id":"qNMfF9TYETM","title":"Trailer de Java e Bedrock","kind":"TRAILER"}],"screenshots":["https://img.youtube.com/vi/MmB9b5njVbA/hqdefault.jpg","https://img.youtube.com/vi/qNMfF9TYETM/hqdefault.jpg"],"score":"93","tagline":"Explore, construa e invente seu próprio jeito de jogar.","description":"Um sandbox de blocos sobre exploração, construção e sobrevivência. O mundo é gerado proceduralmente, e cada jogador pode transformar seus recursos em casas, mecanismos, aventuras e histórias próprias.","highlights":["Criatividade sem uma rota obrigatória","Sobrevivência, construção e exploração","Mundos para jogar sozinho ou com amigos"],"steamAppId":null,"franchise":"Minecraft","category":"Jogo","availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"","communityReview":null}'),
  ('persona-5-royal', 'Persona 5 Royal', '2022', 'Persona 5 Royal', 'Jogo', '95', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1687950/library_600x900_2x.jpg', 'https://store.steampowered.com/app/1687950/', '{"id":"persona-5-royal","steamAppId":1687950,"name":"Persona 5 Royal","originalName":"PERSONA 5 ROYAL","year":2022,"releaseDate":"20 out. 2022","developer":"ATLUS","publisher":"SEGA","franchise":"Persona 5 Royal","category":"Jogo","genres":["RPG"],"platforms":["PC"],"modes":[],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1687950/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"provider":"steam","id":"256911919","title":"Launch Trailer (Unrated)","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1687950/506609/4ee1371464ce2149f69f89c36b9f906e369db2f1/1750725763/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1722428147","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256911919/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1722428147"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256901688","title":"Pre-Purchase Trailer (Unrated)","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1687950/489147/4fcaa04edfbb3489dcda45a463851fe76e216736/1750725734/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1663167631","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256901688/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1663167631"}],"screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/ss_663171dc3afce8fe987e57e8659f91b69faa39bc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783356822","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/ss_a3258aba84ae2f2ff13a02a160f7495bfc152adb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783356822","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/ss_ddcc016b8e5c434ccbd1a89c0157ce73acf905ae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783356822","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/ss_c665872b4c5cb3a4e4fd3a4abde97ee60fe51e33.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783356822","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/ss_63d2164bf39a43905e9602381f43a9ad4ab46dea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783356822","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/ss_38d09e40dd56df43a1bb083dc94e27cb1360b526.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783356822"],"score":"95","tagline":"Lidera os Phantom Thieves of Hearts neste premiado RPG por turnos cheio de estilo e repleto de masmorras, com personalização de grupos, combate estratégico e fusão Persona. Explora Tóquio, constrói relações, combate Shadows e infiltra-te nas mentes dos corruptos para que mudem o seu comportamento!","description":"Prepara-te para uma experiência RPG galardoada com esta edição definitiva do Persona 5 Royal, que inclui um monte de conteúdo transferível adicional! \\n\\n Forçado a transferir-se para um liceu em Tóquio, o protagonista tem um sonho estranho. “És realmente um prisioneiro do destino. Num futuro próximo, a ruína espera por ti.” Com o objetivo da “reabilitação” pendente, ele terá de salvar outros dos seus desejos sombrios ao vestir a máscara de um Phantom Thief. \\n\\n Principais destaques:\\n - Explora Tóquio, desbloqueia Personas, personaliza a tua base de operações, descobre finais alternativos e mais ainda\\n - Torna-te o melhor Phantom Thief e desafia as convenções, descobre o poder dentro de ti e luta pela justiça na versão definitiva do Persona 5 Royal\\n - Inclui mais de 40 itens de conteúdos adicionais lançados anteriormente \\n - Escolhe entre as vozes em japonês e inglês","highlights":["RPG","Confira os trailers e as imagens da ficha."],"specs":null,"availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1687950/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Extremamente positivas","totalReviews":143604,"positive":138341,"negative":5263,"recommendPercent":96,"praise":"Estilo visual, elenco e o vínculo com os Phantom Thieves formam a experiência mais elogiada.","caveat":"A campanha longa e a necessidade de conexão em alguns cenários de uso são pontos de atenção citados.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1687950/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
  ('portal-2', 'Portal 2', '2011', 'Portal 2', 'Jogo', '95', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/620/library_600x900_2x.jpg', 'https://store.steampowered.com/app/620/', '{"id":"portal-2","steamAppId":620,"name":"Portal 2","originalName":"PORTAL 2","year":2011,"releaseDate":"18 abr. 2011","developer":"Valve","publisher":"Valve","franchise":"Portal 2","category":"Jogo","genres":["Ação","Aventura"],"platforms":["PC","Linux"],"modes":["Co-op","Co-op online","Co-op, ecrã partilhado/dividido"],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/620/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"provider":"steam","id":"5787","title":"Portal 2 E3 Demo (Excursion Funnels)","kind":"GAMEPLAY","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/620/3746/0f4bee66d490b637707ac4fca3e850f2cc2d3b2a/1750108721/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1682715616","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5787/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1682715616"},{"provider":"steam","id":"80822","title":"Portal 2 Remix Trailer","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/620/5096/2bbd128dd4e1d90aa6f688fb91e6665a301f48c5/1750108756/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1683129612","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/80822/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1683129612"},{"provider":"steam","id":"81613","title":"Portal 2 - Perpetual Testing Initiative","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/620/7495/c992fec9601198bd42fc3563a62c932b8dc032cb/1750108756/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1682715589","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/81613/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1682715589"},{"provider":"steam","id":"5926","title":"Portal 2 Co-op Trailer","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/620/4105/75674acd6517bf86cad79034131dc7853c2967cb/1750109925/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1682715596","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5926/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1682715596"},{"provider":"steam","id":"5739","title":"Portal 2 Teaser","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/620/3670/be99f50a782b0258dcf3d6b0d0d3d24c28da0568/1750108717/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1682715602","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5739/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1682715602"}],"screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620/ss_f3f6787d74739d3b2ec8a484b5c994b3d31ef325.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790187113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620/ss_6a4f5afdaa98402de9cf0b59fed27bab3256a6f4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790187113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620/ss_0cdd90fafc160b52d08b303d205f9fd4e83cf164.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790187113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620/ss_ec35a739b4b33270eb170d9e561c5b016cba50a6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790187113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620/ss_3d13161104a04603a0524536770c5f74626db4c0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790187113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620/ss_8a772608d29ffd56ac013d2ac7c4388b96e87a21.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790187113"],"score":"95","tagline":"A \\"Iniciativa de Testes Perpétuos\\" foi expandida para permitir que cries puzzles co-op para ti e os teus amigos!","description":"O Portal 2 é baseado na premiada fórmula de jogabilidade, história e música inovadoras que garantiu ao Portal original mais de 70 prémios e criou um culto entre os fãs.\\n\\n A porção de um jogador de Portal 2 introduz um elenco de novas personagens dinâmicas, novos elementos de puzzle e um conjunto muito maior de tortuosas câmaras de teste. Os jogadores irão explorar áreas nunca antes vistas dos Laboratórios da Aperture Science e serão reunidos com GLaDOS, o computador ocasionalmente homicida que os guiou através do jogo original.\\n\\n O modo cooperativo de dois jogadores apresenta a sua própria campanha com uma história e câmaras de teste únicas e duas novas personagens jogáveis. Este novo modo força os jogadores a pôr em causa tudo aquilo que pensavam saber acerca dos portais. O sucesso irá não só requerer que os jogadores ajam cooperativamente, mas também que pensem cooperativamente.\\n\\n Características do produto \\n Modo de um jogador extensivo: Com jogabilidade de próxima geração e uma história fascinante.\\n\\n Modo cooperativo completo para duas pessoas: Modo multijogador com a sua própria história, personagens e jogabilidade dedicadas.\\n\\n Física avançada: Permite a criação de todo um novo conjunto de interessantes desafios, produzindo um jogo muito maior, sem aumentar a sua dificuldade.\\n\\n Música original. \\n\\n Sequela massiva: O Portal original foi nomeado Jogo do Ano em 2007 por mais de 30 publicações em todo o mundo. \\n\\n Ferramentas de edição: As ferramentas de edição do Portal 2 estão incluídas.","highlights":["Ação","Aventura","Co-op","Confira os trailers e as imagens da ficha."],"specs":null,"availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/620/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Extremamente positivas","totalReviews":469793,"positive":463717,"negative":6076,"recommendPercent":99,"praise":"Puzzles inventivos, humor e ritmo de campanha continuam agradando em novas partidas.","caveat":"Alguns relatos citam limitações de compatibilidade e suporte em sistemas ou controles específicos.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/620/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
  ('red-dead-redemption-2', 'Red Dead Redemption 2', '2018', 'Red Dead Redemption 2', 'Jogo', '93', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1174180/library_600x900_2x.jpg', 'https://store.steampowered.com/app/1174180/', '{"id":"red-dead-redemption-2","name":"Red Dead Redemption 2","originalName":"RED DEAD REDEMPTION 2","year":2018,"releaseDate":"26 de outubro de 2018","developer":"Rockstar Studios","publisher":"Rockstar Games","genres":["Ação","Aventura","Mundo aberto"],"platforms":["PC","PlayStation 4","Xbox One"],"modes":["Um jogador","Multijogador online"],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1174180/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"id":"eaW0tYpxyp0","title":"Trailer oficial #3","kind":"TRAILER"},{"id":"Dw_oH5oiUSE","title":"Vídeo oficial de gameplay","kind":"GAMEPLAY"}],"screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174180/ss_66b553f4c209476d3e4ce25fa4714002cc914c4f.1920x1080.jpg","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174180/ss_bac60bacbf5da8945103648c08d27d5e202444ca.1920x1080.jpg","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174180/ss_668dafe477743f8b50b818d5bbfcec669e9ba93e.1920x1080.jpg","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174180/ss_4ce07ae360b166f0f650e9a895a3b4b7bf15e34f.1920x1080.jpg"],"score":"93","tagline":"O fim da era do Velho Oeste está próximo. Até onde você iria pelo seu grupo?","description":"Acompanhe Arthur Morgan e a gangue Van der Linde em uma história de sobrevivência no fim da era dos fora da lei. Um mundo aberto detalhado mistura missões, encontros inesperados e atividades pelo Oeste americano.","highlights":["Narrativa centrada em Arthur Morgan","Mundo aberto reativo e detalhado","Exploração e atividades variadas"],"steamAppId":1174180,"franchise":"Red Dead Redemption 2","category":"Jogo","availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1174180/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Muito positivas","totalReviews":937014,"positive":867288,"negative":69726,"recommendPercent":93,"praise":"Narrativa, personagens e atenção aos detalhes do mundo aberto são frequentemente celebrados.","caveat":"Ritmo deliberado, bugs persistentes e problemas com launcher ou acesso aparecem entre as ressalvas.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1174180/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
  ('resident-evil-4', 'Resident Evil 4', '2023', 'Resident Evil 4', 'Jogo', '91', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/2050650/library_600x900_2x.jpg', 'https://store.steampowered.com/app/2050650/', '{"id":"resident-evil-4","steamAppId":2050650,"name":"Resident Evil 4","originalName":"RESIDENT EVIL 4","year":2023,"releaseDate":"23 mar. 2023","developer":"CAPCOM Co., Ltd.","publisher":"CAPCOM Co., Ltd.","franchise":"Resident Evil 4","category":"Jogo","genres":["Ação","Aventura"],"platforms":["PC"],"modes":[],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/2050650/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"provider":"steam","id":"256998127","title":"08【RE4】_GELaunchPV_Multi_BR_FullHD_DJCTQ_好評発売中.mp4","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2050650/657548/d66cd4cfb24cc35f67d237b146e00ffd2df5f6bd/1750745210/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1730246640","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256998127/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1730246640"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256938325","title":"08【RE4】_PV3_Multi_BR_FullHD_DJCTQ_AfterRelease","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2050650/552832/74e87283277f47b96027be205d63f4866add8112/1750745169/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1680071415","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256938325/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1680071415"}],"screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050650/ss_59d1b19964cc532213df92c8287b75a0bffeb33c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772502922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050650/ss_ab807f8ad9e968a620777caf483cb6020367b9ee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772502922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050650/ss_0442f7fb4327d79802c2db8ea8d23d228a28d896.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772502922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050650/ss_69810f4cd155912fdfdd21da70181df7d454c874.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772502922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050650/ss_0596bac955340495562f3ff2538756ebd9a7f073.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772502922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050650/ss_0554b945aafc847d55f780f7968de00aafa968a3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772502922"],"score":"91","tagline":"A sobrevivência é apenas o início. Com jogabilidade melhorada, uma história reimaginada e grafismos detalhados, Resident Evil 4 é o renascer de um clássico. Volta a viver o pesadelo que revolucionou os jogos de terror e sobrevivência.","description":"A sobrevivência é apenas o início.\\n\\nPassaram seis anos desde o desastre biológico de Raccoon City. O agente Leon S. Kennedy, um dos poucos sobreviventes do incidente, foi enviado para salvar a filha raptada do presidente. Leon consegue encontrá-la numa aldeia isolada na Europa, onde algo terrível terá acontecido aos seus habitantes. Assim sobe a cortina desta história de salvamento e terror, onde a vida e a morte, o terror e a catarse, se encontram.\\n\\nCom jogabilidade melhorada, uma história reimaginada e grafismos detalhados, Resident Evil 4 é o renascer de um clássico.\\n\\nVolta a viver o pesadelo que revolucionou os jogos de terror e sobrevivência.","highlights":["Ação","Aventura","Confira os trailers e as imagens da ficha."],"specs":null,"availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2050650/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Extremamente positivas","totalReviews":288914,"positive":281343,"negative":7571,"recommendPercent":97,"praise":"Combate, atmosfera e vontade de rejogar são destaques para muitos fãs do remake.","caveat":"Parte dos fãs prefere o original e critica mudanças, cortes ou diferenças de ritmo.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2050650/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
  ('resident-evil-village', 'Resident Evil Village', '2021', 'Resident Evil Village', 'Jogo', '83', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1196590/library_600x900_2x.jpg', 'https://store.steampowered.com/app/1196590/', '{"id":"resident-evil-village","steamAppId":1196590,"name":"Resident Evil Village","originalName":"RESIDENT EVIL VILLAGE","year":2021,"releaseDate":"6 mai. 2021","developer":"CAPCOM Co., Ltd.","publisher":"CAPCOM Co., Ltd.","franchise":"Resident Evil Village","category":"Jogo","genres":["Ação"],"platforms":["PC"],"modes":[],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1196590/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"provider":"steam","id":"256825274","title":"Village_PV3_Multi_03_DJCTQ_FullHD.mp4","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1196590/353097/ab42831befc22df81eaefe3d5e9fc239f335dfc3/1750637462/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1615523888","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256825274/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1615523888"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256825260","title":"Village_2ndTrailer_Multi_03_DJCTQ_FullHD.mp4","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1196590/353082/4db66add7f0276c31c530a14d604c5c76fef6ce9/1750637358/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1615523986","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256825260/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1615523986"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256789696","title":"Village-SpecialDevMessage_ASIA_1080p.mp4","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1196590/293064/2cf72d2ac972bfd4babb96fa531b414cd6b0449a/1750637269/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1592542872","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256789696/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1592542872"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256788760","title":"Village_AnnounceTrailer_Multi_03_DJCTQ_FullHD.mp4","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1196590/291698/fd3804864015aea09720f751949372c933b7fc86/1750837071/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1591953107","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256788760/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1591953107"}],"screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1196590/ss_d25704b01be292d1337df4fea0fba2aab322b58a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776927117","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1196590/ss_8113ec993ec474055c4cdce5ee86f91f7cf6663f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776927117","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1196590/ss_50283e6df9d2f3f24ff4a1a36a94ae307e21cee8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776927117","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1196590/ss_363d9c05ee0a974b766938610a3352e7a89b9c92.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776927117","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1196590/ss_e2bdaa9a0eeae714b3ad3ba49c9ae83a3930f08e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776927117","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1196590/ss_d296efbc9a5d87bf20b2ea19134f35ba203ae813.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776927117"],"score":"83","tagline":"Vive o horror da sobrevivência como nunca antes em Resident Evil Village, a oitava edição da saga Resident Evil. Com gráficos hiperdetalhados, ação na primeira pessoa intensa e uma narrativa magistral, o terror nunca foi tão realista e inevitável.","description":"Vive o horror da sobrevivência como nunca antes em Resident Evil Village, a oitava edição da saga Resident Evil.\\n\\nA nova narrativa decorre alguns anos após os horríveis acontecimentos do aclamado Resident Evil 7 Biohazard, e começa com Ethan Winters e a sua esposa Mia a viverem pacificamente num local novo e livre dos pesadelos passados. Empenhados em construir uma nova vida juntos, a tragédia volta a atingi-los.\\n\\n CARATERÍSTICAS \\n Ação na primeira pessoa: os jogadores vão assumir o papel de Ethan Winters, com quem vão viver todas as perseguições aterrorizantes e lutas bem de perto, numa perspetiva na primeira pessoa. \\n\\n Faces familiares e novos inimigos: Chris Redfield tem sido um habitual herói da série Resident Evil, mas a sua aparição em Resident Evil Village aparenta ter motivações sinistras. Uma série de novos adversários que habitam a enigmática vila caçam incansavelmente Ethan, dificultando os seus movimentos enquanto ele tenta compreender o novo pesadelo em que se encontra.","highlights":["Ação","Confira os trailers e as imagens da ficha."],"specs":null,"availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1196590/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Extremamente positivas","totalReviews":157259,"positive":150396,"negative":6863,"recommendPercent":96,"praise":"Cenários marcantes, exploração e a mistura de ação com horror conquistam jogadores.","caveat":"Alguns sentem falta do terror mais intenso de RE7 e criticam a história ou o tom mais voltado à ação.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1196590/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
  ('sea-of-stars-sunset-edition', 'Sea of Stars: Sunset Edition', '2023', 'Sea of Stars: Sunset Edition', 'Jogo', '87', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1244090/library_600x900_2x.jpg', 'https://store.steampowered.com/app/1244090/', '{"id":"sea-of-stars-sunset-edition","steamAppId":1244090,"name":"Sea of Stars: Sunset Edition","originalName":"SEA OF STARS: SUNSET EDITION","year":2023,"releaseDate":"28 ago. 2023","developer":"Sabotage Studio","publisher":"Sabotage Studio","franchise":"Sea of Stars: Sunset Edition","category":"Jogo","genres":["Aventura","Indie","RPG"],"platforms":["PC"],"modes":["Co-op","Co-op, ecrã partilhado/dividido"],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1244090/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"provider":"steam","id":"256995688","title":"Sea of Stars - Accolades Trailer","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1244090/653097/1c9f814a652a3de4a222d665bb6fd42aa06f41da/1750649021/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1713369240","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256995688/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1713369240"},{"provider":"steam","id":"257071675","title":"Sea of Stars - Dawn of Equinox","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1244090/782766/f4333bf152e3406247516b59d5d5b286a4d157af/1750649024/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1731423723","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257071675/395fdfe6a861bc5dbf4116f9434884d00d1445e7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1731423723"}],"screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1244090/ss_f756ff477590284c7192ffcef99237de056e4aeb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780931183","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1244090/ss_c250a7fd789b3cbab5ca8e99e3530cf933656ad1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780931183","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1244090/ss_889d4ddea7d0884d9d370dd280878570824e68fe.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780931183","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1244090/ss_cb9259d083c9d42db9b1f1197e030f8f85d42198.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780931183","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1244090/ss_e7ac3a6e5ebe5f4561fc46d116c33678cf4ba811.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780931183","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1244090/ss_3fe41c00a7122c63aa05b4ea331c6f995e356788.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780931183"],"score":"87","tagline":"Sea of Stars is a turn-based RPG inspired by the classics. It tells the story of two Children of the Solstice who will combine the powers of the sun and moon to perform Eclipse Magic, the only force capable of fending off the monstrous creations of the evil alchemist known as The Fleshmancer.","description":"Promising the Sabotage touch in every system, Sea of Stars aims to modernize the classic RPG in terms of turn-based combat, storytelling, exploration and interactions with the environment, while still offering a hearty slice of nostalgia and good old, simple fun. \\n\\n Pressing the action button in sync with the animations increases damage output while reducing incoming damage. Along with timed hits, combat features multi-character combo attacks, boosting, and a strategic \\"locks\\" system offering options to play with different damage types in order to hinder enemies while they are channeling powerful attacks or spells, all in an immersive take on the genre; no random encounters, no transitions to separate battlefields, and no grinding. \\n\\n Swim, climb, vault, jump off or hoist up ledges as you traverse seamlessly through the world with a navigation system based on platformer expertise that breaks free from the classic bound-to-the-grid tileset movement. \\n\\n Our custom-made render pipeline allows the creation of a breathtaking world coming to life by pushing the limits of 2D pixel-art games. \\n\\n Dozens of original characters and story arcs will take you on a captivating journey. Sometimes epic, sometimes silly, and other times emotional, Sea of Stars does its RPG duty of exploring classic themes of adventure and friendship, while also being chock-full of the unexpected twists and events you’d expect from a Sabotage production.\\n\\n There are many ways to hang out in the world of Sea of Stars if you feel the need for a change of pace in your adventures. Sailing, cooking, fishing, stopping by a tavern to listen to a song or play the infamous tabletop game known as \\"Wheels\\".....every system has been designed to deliver an experience that pays respect to retro classics, while rethinking in some areas to offer a smooth and modernized experience.\\n\\n Sea of Stars’ adventure is playable in its entirety by up to three players. Allies can drop in and out anytime to traverse the world together and master the Co-op Timed Hits combat mechanic. Also available via Steam Remote Play Together.","highlights":["Aventura","Indie","Co-op","Confira os trailers e as imagens da ficha."],"specs":null,"availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1244090/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Muito positivas","totalReviews":15877,"positive":14022,"negative":1855,"recommendPercent":88,"praise":"Pixel art, iluminação e música evocam JRPGs clássicos de forma atraente.","caveat":"As críticas apontam narrativa, personagens e combate menos envolventes que a apresentação sugere.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1244090/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
  ('sekiro-shadows-die-twice-goty-edition', 'Sekiro™: Shadows Die Twice - GOTY Edition', '2019', 'Sekiro™: Shadows Die Twice - GOTY Edition', 'Jogo', '88', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/814380/library_600x900_2x.jpg', 'https://store.steampowered.com/app/814380/', '{"id":"sekiro-shadows-die-twice-goty-edition","steamAppId":814380,"name":"Sekiro™: Shadows Die Twice - GOTY Edition","originalName":"SEKIRO™: SHADOWS DIE TWICE - GOTY EDITION","year":2019,"releaseDate":"21 mar. 2019","developer":"FromSoftware, Inc.","publisher":"Activision (Excluding Japan and Asia), FromSoftware, Inc. (Japan), 方块游戏 (Asia)","franchise":"Sekiro™: Shadows Die Twice - GOTY Edition","category":"Jogo","genres":["Ação","Aventura"],"platforms":["PC"],"modes":[],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/814380/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"provider":"steam","id":"256806899","title":"Sekiro™: Shadows Die Twice - Game of the Year Edition","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/814380/322401/63cf1fdf9c16536f04b08a5b1939909f7a99a340/1750586450/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1603837979","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256806899/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1603837979"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256770769","title":"Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice - Accolades Trailer","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/814380/258713/980f4296ce65afd30dae955677b95c54fb7f0aa5/1750586418/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1576898083","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256770769/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1576898083"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256745700","title":"Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice - Gameplay 101 Trailer","kind":"GAMEPLAY","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/814380/214066/8028d7d95132f516fe298ed58b88905e2a33757c/1750586397/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1553549458","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256745700/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1553549458"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256745081","title":"Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice - Launch Trailer","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/814380/212986/8ba6fe8bdcdc79872f903015b5d52e1121c1fdee/1750586380/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1553549470","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256745081/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1553549470"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256742445","title":"Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice - Story Trailer","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/814380/208296/626c8f3fa4310e48981ed9642700c23fe18bfc6b/1750586375/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1553550374","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256742445/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1553550374"}],"screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814380/ss_0f7b0f8ed9ffc49aba26f9328caa9a1d59ad60f0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762888662","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814380/ss_2685dd844a2a523b6c7ec207d46a538db6a908cd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762888662","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814380/ss_15f0e9982621aed44900215ad283811af0779b1d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762888662","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814380/ss_1e6f5540866a5564d65df915c22fe1e57e336a6f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762888662","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814380/ss_3d6b38c382c0eafb02dc90d22f33fd292e4e5cf3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762888662"],"score":"88","tagline":"Jogo do ano - The Game Awards 2019 Melhor jogo de ação de 2019 - IGN Talha o teu próprio caminho para uma vingança inteligente nesta aventura galardoada concebida pela FromSoftware, os criadores de Bloodborne e da série Dark Souls. Vinga-te. Restaura a tua honra. Mata com engenho.","description":"Esta Edição Jogo do Ano inclui agora conteúdo de bónus*:\\n\\n- Reflection e Gauntlet of Strength - novos modos de desafio de bosses\\n\\n- Remnants - deixa mensagens e gravações que os outros jogadores podem ver e classificar\\n\\n- 3 skins cosméticas desbloqueáveis\\n\\nJogo do ano - The Game Awards 2019\\n\\nMelhor jogo de ação de 2019 - IGN\\n\\nMais de 50 prémios e nomeações\\n\\nTalha o teu próprio caminho para uma vingança inteligente nesta nova aventura concebida pela FromSoftware, os criadores da série Dark Souls.\\n\\nNo Sekiro™: Shadows Die Twice tu és o ''lobo sem um braço'', um guerreiro desonrado e desfigurado, salvo às portas da morte. Obrigado a proteger um jovem senhor que é descendente de uma antiga linhagem, irás tornar-te o alvo de muitos inimigos ferozes, incluindo o perigoso clã Ashina. Quando o jovem lorde é capturado, nada te impedirá de partir numa perigosa missão para reconquistares a tua honra, nem mesmo a própria morte.\\n\\nExplora o Japão Sengoku do final dos anos 1500, um período brutal de conflitos ininterruptos de vida ou morte, quando te deparas com inimigos poderosíssimos num mundo sombrio e sinuoso. Solta um arsenal de próteses mortais que são as tuas ferramentas e usa poderosas habilidades de ninja ao combinares o combate furtivo, travessais verticais e um corpo a corpo visceral num confronto sangrento.\\n\\nVinga-te. Recupera a tua honra. Mata de forma engenhosa.\\n\\n*Requer transferência.\\n\\nRequer ligação à internet para Multijogador assíncrono.","highlights":["Ação","Aventura","Confira os trailers e as imagens da ficha."],"specs":null,"availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/814380/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Extremamente positivas","totalReviews":359972,"positive":342846,"negative":17126,"recommendPercent":95,"praise":"A satisfação de dominar a defesa e os duelos com chefes é o grande destaque.","caveat":"A exigência de precisão pode ser frustrante, e alguns relatos mencionam problemas de resolução no PC.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/814380/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
  ('stardew-valley', 'Stardew Valley', '2016', 'Stardew Valley', 'Jogo', '89', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/413150/library_600x900_2x.jpg', 'https://store.steampowered.com/app/413150/', '{"id":"stardew-valley","steamAppId":413150,"name":"Stardew Valley","originalName":"STARDEW VALLEY","year":2016,"releaseDate":"26 fev. 2016","developer":"ConcernedApe","publisher":"ConcernedApe","franchise":"Stardew Valley","category":"Jogo","genres":["Indie","RPG","Simulação"],"platforms":["PC","macOS","Linux"],"modes":["Co-op","Co-op online","Co-op em LAN","Co-op, ecrã partilhado/dividido"],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/413150/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"provider":"steam","id":"256815967","title":"Stardew Valley Trailer 1080p","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/413150/336433/0058de516bf7c46986ba1e81172ffd3c2ca6cad7/1750527541/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754692862","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256815967/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1754692862"}],"screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413150/ss_b887651a93b0525739049eb4194f633de2df75be.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786554168","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413150/ss_9ac899fe2cda15d48b0549bba77ef8c4a090a71c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786554168","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413150/ss_4fa0866709ede3753fdf2745349b528d5e8c4054.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786554168","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413150/ss_d836f0a5b0447fb6a2bdb0a6ac5f954949d3c41e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786554168","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413150/ss_10628b4a811c0a925a1433d4323f78c7017dbbe4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786554168","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413150/ss_6422d297347258086b389e3d5d9c0e0c698312e4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786554168"],"score":"89","tagline":"You''ve inherited your grandfather''s old farm plot in Stardew Valley. Armed with hand-me-down tools and a few coins, you set out to begin your new life. Can you learn to live off the land and turn these overgrown fields into a thriving home?","description":"Stardew Valley is an open-ended country-life RPG! \\n\\nYou''ve inherited your grandfather''s old farm plot in Stardew Valley. Armed with hand-me-down tools and a few coins, you set out to begin your new life. Can you learn to live off the land and turn these overgrown fields into a thriving home? It won''t be easy. Ever since Joja Corporation came to town, the old ways of life have all but disappeared. The community center, once the town''s most vibrant hub of activity, now lies in shambles. But the valley seems full of opportunity. With a little dedication, you might just be the one to restore Stardew Valley to greatness!\\n\\n Features \\n Turn your overgrown field into a lively farm! Raise animals, grow crops, start an orchard, craft useful machines, and more! You''ll have plenty of space to create the farm of your dreams. \\n\\n 8 Player Farming! Invite 1-7 players to join you in the valley online! Players can work together to build a thriving farm, share resources, and improve the local community. As more hands are better than one, players have the option to scale profit margin on produce sold for a more challenging experience.\\n\\n Improve your skills over time. As you make your way from a struggling greenhorn to a master farmer, you''ll level up in 5 different areas: farming, mining, combat, fishing, and foraging. As you progress, you''ll learn new cooking and crafting recipes, unlock new areas to explore, and customize your skills by choosing from a variety of professions. \\n\\n Become part of the local community. With over 30 unique characters living in Stardew Valley, you won''t have a problem finding new friends! Each person has their own daily schedule, birthday, unique mini-cutscenes, and new things to say throughout the week and year. As you make friends with them, they will open up to you, ask you for help with their personal troubles, or tell you their secrets! Take part in seasonal festivals such as the luau, haunted maze, and feast of the winter star. \\n\\n Explore a vast, mysterious cave. As you travel deeper underground, you''ll encounter new and dangerous monsters, powerful weapons, new environments, valuable gemstones, raw materials for crafting and upgrading tools, and mysteries to be uncovered. \\n\\n Breathe new life into the valley. Since JojaMart opened, the old way of life in Stardew Valley has changed. Much of the town''s infrastructure has fallen into disrepair. Help restore Stardew Valley to it''s former glory by repairing the old community center, or take the alternate route and join forces with Joja Corporation.\\n\\n Court and marry a partner to share your life on the farm with. There are 12 available bachelors and bachelorettes to woo, each with unique character progression cutscenes. Once married, your partner will live on the farm with you. Who knows, maybe you''ll have kids and start a family?\\n\\n Spend a relaxing afternoon at one of the local fishing spots. The waters are teeming with seasonal varieties of delicious fish. Craft bait, bobbers, and crab pots to help you in your journey toward catching every fish and becoming a local legend! \\n\\n Donate artifacts and minerals to the local museum. \\n\\n Cook delicious meals and craft useful items to help you out. With over 100 cooking and crafting recipes, you''ll have a wide variety of items to create. Some dishes you cook will even give you temporary boosts to skills, running speed, or combat prowess. Craft useful objects like scarecrows, oil makers, furnaces, or even the rare and expensive crystalarium. \\n\\n Customize the appearance of your character and house. With hundreds of decorative items to choose from, you''ll have no trouble creating the home of your dreams!\\n\\n Xbox controller support (with rumble)! (Keyboard still required for text input) \\n\\n Over two hours of original music.","highlights":["Indie","RPG","Co-op","Confira os trailers e as imagens da ficha."],"specs":null,"availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/413150/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Extremamente positivas","totalReviews":1050976,"positive":1035035,"negative":15941,"recommendPercent":98,"praise":"Liberdade para cuidar da fazenda no próprio ritmo e o conteúdo acolhedor mantêm jogadores por muito tempo.","caveat":"Minimizar tarefas pode transformar a rotina em trabalho, e combate ou cavernas não agradam a todos.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/413150/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
  ('subnautica', 'Subnautica', '2018', 'Subnautica', 'Jogo', '87', 'https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/264710/library_600x900_2x.jpg', 'https://store.steampowered.com/app/264710/', '{"id":"subnautica","steamAppId":264710,"name":"Subnautica","originalName":"SUBNAUTICA","year":2018,"releaseDate":"23 jan. 2018","developer":"Unknown Worlds Entertainment","publisher":"Unknown Worlds Entertainment","franchise":"Subnautica","category":"Jogo","genres":["Aventura","Indie"],"platforms":["PC","macOS"],"modes":[],"cover":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/264710/library_600x900_2x.jpg","videos":[{"provider":"steam","id":"256706800","title":"Subnautica Gameplay Trailer","kind":"GAMEPLAY","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/264710/143519/33594902d34e588ce90d9905c30aa902198fea59/1750490623/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1516828564","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256706800/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1516828564"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256706872","title":"Subnautica Cinematic Trailer","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/264710/143714/5edf88beb952621c411bb168a9b08c9e7ef51637/1750490625/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1516824043","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256706872/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1516824043"},{"provider":"steam","id":"2036126","title":"Subnautica Early Access Trailer","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/264710/28654/05ca8a9c6de3c597701bc93e6d7615fb557c852e/1750490540/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1447366004","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2036126/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1447366004"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256662171","title":"Subnautica Early Access Gameplay Montage","kind":"GAMEPLAY","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/264710/55128/06ac53f65e291c5ee42b9e76907f7a3cdef362f6/1750490593/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1518110769","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256662171/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1518110769"},{"provider":"steam","id":"256656451","title":"Subnautica Seamoth Update","kind":"TRAILER","src":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/264710/43042/c9749f04ba1d19d13a2194451143f23b29d39a58/1750490588/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1491210612","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256656451/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1491210612"}],"screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264710/ss_e182b6b20bb797500f9f63c561586d920d44e37c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777456112","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264710/ss_970a13f246e33e0df26d93baf9f8e975732adb4b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777456112","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264710/ss_5f2f2ea498cdc632cbffd6cf37c1a09670eb3272.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777456112","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264710/ss_cebc378d2f7bc78978c21db4e3c5e12ccd067349.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777456112","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264710/ss_0ace7f8b4350b8fbdd16345a76bc30545256e918.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777456112","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264710/ss_f0eeabe108c2bc2b3e370b9828fb280035b50db2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777456112"],"score":"87","tagline":"Descend into the depths of an alien underwater world filled with wonder and peril. Craft equipment, pilot submarines and out-smart wildlife to explore lush coral reefs, volcanoes, cave systems, and more - all while trying to survive.","description":"Subnautica is an underwater adventure game set on an alien ocean planet. A massive, open world full of wonder and peril awaits you! Dive Into a Vast Underwater World\\n\\nYou have crash-landed on an alien ocean world, and the only way to go is down. Subnautica''s oceans range from sun drenched shallow coral reefs to treacherous deep-sea trenches, lava fields, and bio-luminescent underwater rivers. Manage your oxygen supply as you explore kelp forests, plateaus, reefs, and winding cave systems. The water teems with life: Some of it helpful, much of it harmful. Scavenge, Craft, and Survive\\n\\nAfter crash landing in your Life Pod, the clock is ticking to find water, food, and to develop the equipment you need to explore. Collect resources from the ocean around you. Craft diving gear, lights, habitat modules, and submersibles. Venture deeper and further form to find rarer resources, allowing you to craft more advanced items. Construct Underwater Habitats\\n\\nBuild bases on the sea floor. Choose layouts and components, and manage hull-integrity as depth and pressure increase. Use your base to store resources, park vehicles, and replenish oxygen supplies as you explore the vast ocean. Unravel the Mystery\\n\\nWhat happened to this planet? Signs abound that something is not right. What caused you to crash? What is infecting the sea life? Who built the mysterious structures scattered around the ocean? Can you find a way to make it off the planet alive? Disrupt the Food Chain\\n\\nThe ocean teems with life: Use the ecosystem to help you. Lure and distract a threatening creature with a fresh fish, or simply swim as fast as you can to avoid gnashing jaws of roaming predators. Handle the Pressure\\n\\nBuild a Pressure Re-Active Waterproof Nanosuit, or PRAWN Suit, and explore extreme depth and heat. Modify the suit with mining drills, torpedo launchers, propulsion cannons, grappling hooks and more. Fear the Night\\n\\nAs the sun goes down, the predators come out. The ocean is unforgiving of those caught unprepared in the darkness. Areas that are safe to explore during the day become treacherous at night, but also reveal a beauty that those who hide from the darkness will never see. Dive Below the Ocean Floor\\n\\nCave systems wind below the sea bed, from dark claustrophobic passages to caverns lit by bio-luminescent life and burning-hot lava flows. Explore the world below the ocean floor, but watch your oxygen levels, and take care to avoid the threats lurking in the darkness. About the Development Team\\n\\nSubnautica is being created by Unknown Worlds, a small studio founded by Charlie Cleveland and Max McGuire that traces its roots back to the 2003 Half-Life mod Natural Selection. The team is scattered around the globe, from the United States to the United Kingdom, France, the Czech Republic, Russia, Thailand, Australia, and many more places. There is a central office in San Francisco, California that serves as home base for the whole team.\\n\\n Warning\\n\\nThis game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.","highlights":["Aventura","Indie","Confira os trailers e as imagens da ficha."],"specs":null,"availability":"Lançado","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/264710/","communityReview":{"platform":"Steam","scoreLabel":"Extremamente positivas","totalReviews":383680,"positive":372526,"negative":11154,"recommendPercent":97,"praise":"Exploração, atmosfera e descoberta gradual da história são os aspectos mais elogiados.","caveat":"O começo pode parecer lento, e jogadores relatam limitações no suporte a VR.","updatedAt":"2026-11-16T14:18:49.889Z","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/264710/?l=brazilian#app_reviews_hash"}}'),
